            "review_title": "Review at Ốc Thảo-Tạ Quang Bửu,Quận8",
            "review_text": "Matthew B\n11 contributions\n2\nFresh seafood, large, but worth visiting!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nSeafood here is fresh, processed hard, eating is good quality. The bar space is spacious, cool, comfortable sitting even for group travel. The most crowded restaurant is the weekend, so those who want a nice place should book a table in advance or book a private room early. Fair price compared to freshness and quantity. Fast service, enthusiastic staff. I recommend it to those who like the 8th District.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 18, 2026",
