            "review_text": "Odyssey23662261451\nVietnam9 contributions\n0\nA Relaxed and Delicious Seafood Find in Ho Chi Minh City\nApr 2026 • Friends\nI visited this place by chance with a friend from the U.S., and it turned out to be such a great experience. The atmosphere was very relaxed and comfortable, and the seafood was fresh, flavorful, and really enjoyable. Everything felt local, lively, and easy to enjoy without being too crowded or stressful. If you are looking for delicious seafood in Ho Chi Minh City, this is definitely one of the places worth trying.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 17, 2026\nTuấn Nghĩa L\nThank you so much for your kind review and for visiting Oc Thao. We’re very happy to know you had a relaxed and enjoyable experience with us. Your support means a lot to our team, and we truly appreciate your recommendation. We look forward to welcoming you back for more fresh seafood and good moments in Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nWritten April 17, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
